      ],
      "source": "https://www.telluride.gov/566/History-of-Telluride"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name comes from tellurium ore, a metalloid whose natural tellurides include gold and silver.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
